VALUES (5416, 'Computer-Aided Architectural Design', 'computer-aided-architectural-design', 'This book is intended to provide a comprehensive introduction to the fundamentals of computer-aided architectural design for the student of architecture, the architect in practice, and the the computer professional who is interested in learning about this emergent application area.\r\n\r\n<strong>Editora</strong>: [acf field="editora"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Midia</strong>: [acf field="midia"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Tema</strong>: [acf field="tema"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Autores</strong>: [acf field="autores"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Idioma</strong>: [acf field="idioma"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Local de publicação</strong>: [acf field="publicacao"]\r\n\r\n<strong>País</strong>: [acf field="pais"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Ano de publicação</strong>: [acf field="ano"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Acervo</strong>: [acf field="tipo_de_acervo"]', 0, (SELECT id FROM product_categories WHERE wp_id = 206 LIMIT 1), 'published', '2020-03-13 15:32:42') 
