VALUES (5419, 'Knowledge-Based Computer-Aided Architectural Design', 'knowledge-based-computer-aided-architectural-design', 'In recent years architectural CAD researchers around the world have focused their attention on the cognitive aspects of the architectural design process. They have constructed models of design knowledge and reasoning, and developed data structures to represent them computationally. This book contains a collection of reports by a select group of researchers, representing the most significant teams working in the area of knowledge-based systems for supporting architectural design. The papers reflect their work to date, and their forecasts for future developments in this area. The issues discussed in the book concern the theories, methods and the systems implementing them, as well as the role of KBCAAD within the larger professional and technical universe of architectural design.\r\n\r\n<strong>Editora</strong>: [acf field="editora"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Midia</strong>: [acf field="midia"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Tema</strong>: [acf field="tema"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Autores</strong>: [acf field="autores"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Idioma</strong>: [acf field="idioma"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Local de publicação</strong>: [acf field="publicacao"]\r\n\r\n<strong>País</strong>: [acf field="pais"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Ano de publicação</strong>: [acf field="ano"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Acervo</strong>: [acf field="tipo_de_acervo"]', 0, (SELECT id FROM product_categories WHERE wp_id = 206 LIMIT 1), 'published', '2020-03-13 15:32:43') 
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
VALUES (5420, 'Revit Architecture 2013 Conceitos e Aplicações', 'revit-architecture-2013-conceitos-e-aplicacoes', 'Destinado a estudantes, arquitetos, engenheiros e profissionais da área que vão introduzir o conceito de BIM (Modelagem da Informação da Construção) no processo de projetos, o livro aborda as principais ferramentas de modelagem do Revit 2013, na versão em português (indicando, também, os principais comandos em inglês), para criação de paredes, estruturas, esquadrias, telhado e terreno, vistas de cortes, elevações e visualização em 3D, bem como a geração de documentação e quantitativos, com um tutorial que permite acompanhar um projeto do início ao término. Apresenta as ferramentas de trabalho em equipe (worksets) necessárias ao compartilhamento das disciplinas do projeto.\r\n\r\n<strong>Editora</strong>: [acf field="editora"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Midia</strong>: [acf field="midia"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Tema</strong>: [acf field="tema"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Autores</strong>: [acf field="autores"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Idioma</strong>: [acf field="idioma"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Local de publicação</strong>: [acf field="publicacao"]\r\n\r\n<strong>País</strong>: [acf field="pais"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Ano de publicação</strong>: [acf field="ano"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Acervo</strong>: [acf field="tipo_de_acervo"]', 0.00, (SELECT id FROM product_categories WHERE wp_id = 207 LIMIT 1), 'published', '2020-03-13 15:32:43') 
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
VALUES (5423, 'Discover Smart BIM An Interactive Guide to ArchiCAD', 'discover-smart-bim-an-interactive-guide-to-archicad', 'Discover Smart BIM: An Interactive Guide to ArchiCAD was developed from more than a decade''s worth of training experience to meet a specific need within the ArchiCAD community. At the time of writing, there is no other known book-based publication that addresses the approach required to learn how to produce a complete Virtual Building&#x2122; Model in ArchiCAD. The emphasis of the book is to guide the intended audience through simple steps to produce a complete Virtual Building&#x2122; Model - covering the most important points such as modelling, visualisation, detailing, scheduling and documentation. - 244 page full colour print - step-by-step detailed instructions - 19 chapters with reference files - 300+ colour illustrations - includes work environment and object library\r\n\r\n<strong>Editora</strong>: [acf field="editora"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Midia</strong>: [acf field="midia"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Tema</strong>: [acf field="tema"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Autores</strong>: [acf field="autores"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Idioma</strong>: [acf field="idioma"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Local de publicação</strong>: [acf field="publicacao"]\r\n\r\n<strong>País</strong>: [acf field="pais"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Ano de publicação</strong>: [acf field="ano"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Acervo</strong>: [acf field="tipo_de_acervo"]', 0, (SELECT id FROM product_categories WHERE wp_id = 204 LIMIT 1), 'published', '2020-03-13 15:32:43') 
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
VALUES (5424, 'Arte de Projetar em Arquitetura', 'arte-de-projetar-em-arquitetura', 'Arte de projetar em arquitetura: princípios, normas e prescrições sobre construção, instalações, distribuição e programa de necessidades, dimensões de edifícios, locais e utensílios.\r\n\r\n<strong>Editora</strong>: [acf field="editora"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Midia</strong>: [acf field="midia"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Tema</strong>: [acf field="tema"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Autores</strong>: [acf field="autores"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Idioma</strong>: [acf field="idioma"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Local de publicação</strong>: [acf field="publicacao"]\r\n\r\n<strong>País</strong>: [acf field="pais"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Ano de publicação</strong>: [acf field="ano"]\r\n\r\n<strong>Acervo</strong>: [acf field="tipo_de_acervo"]', 0, (SELECT id FROM product_categories WHERE wp_id = 204 LIMIT 1), 'published', '2020-03-13 15:32:43') 
